1
00:00:00,555 --> 00:00:03,345
(Penny:)-I'm not sure.
-How can you not be sure?

2
00:00:03,558 --> 00:00:05,388
(Penny:)-This isn't the place to have this.
-No.

3
00:00:05,602 --> 00:00:08,692
The place was in bed after I said,
"I love you"...

4
00:00:08,855 --> 00:00:11,145
(Leonard:)...and you said,
"Thank you. Good night."

5
00:00:11,858 --> 00:00:14,738
(Penny:)-Don't push it, Leonard.
-I am not pushing anything.

6
00:00:14,944 --> 00:00:19,074
(Penny:)You are. You don't get to decide
when I'm ready to say "I love you."

7
00:00:22,869 --> 00:00:26,829
Ah. The premature "I love you."

8
00:00:27,540 --> 00:00:30,500
(Howard:)I guessed premature. Does that count?

9
00:00:36,841 --> 00:00:38,471
(Scene:)Penny.

10
00:00:38,926 --> 00:00:40,556
(Scene:)Penny.

11
00:00:41,679 --> 00:00:43,259
(Scene:)Penny.

12
00:00:44,849 --> 00:00:47,269
(Leonard:)-What?
-This is for you.

13
00:00:49,520 --> 00:00:52,270
(Penny:)-Ice cream?
-I've been familiarizing myself...

14
00:00:52,440 --> 00:00:59,020
(Sheldon:)...with female emotional crises
by studying the comic strip "Cathy."

